+[seal](../src/engine/wal/segment.rs) over both — and that arithmetic belongs to the format. What the
+write path decides is how often it asks the kernel to do something about those bytes, and the shape
+it had since `lakelet/4.1-ingest-protocol` was *twice per record*: one `open` and one `write` inside
+[`Spool::append`](../src/engine/spool.rs), plus one device call per record under a policy that waits
