 ## The promise batching must not break
 
-<!-- TODO: `Spool::append` answers once the record is readable (`crash-points.md`). Say what that
-becomes when one call carries N records, and what a batch that answered first and wrote afterwards
-would look like from the outside: the line the daemon prints
